Scenario: facilityTest1 | User creates a facility with an explicit facility ID
GIVEN user creates a Facility with facility ID 1, name "Startrek", and abbreviation "SK"
WHEN the Facility object is initialized
THEN the facility contains the expected facility ID, name, and abbreviation

Scenario: facilityTest2 | User creates a facility without an explicit facility ID
GIVEN user creates a Facility with name "Startrek" and abbreviation "SK"
WHEN the Facility object is initialized
THEN the facility's ID is -1, and it contains the expected name and abbreviation

Scenario: facilityTest3 | User creates multiple facilities with different details
GIVEN user creates two Facility objects with different IDs, names, and abbreviations
WHEN both Facility objects are initialized
THEN each facility contains its own expected facility ID, name, and abbreviation independently